 "accommodation": {
  "name": "Villa el Cano",
  "blurb": "The first of three straight tours at Villa el Cano – re-christened “Villa El Canine” for the occasion. Sixteen dogs took over the whole place for four nights, with Aloha, Finca Cortesin and Alferini on the golf schedule.\n\nVilla el Cano is a ten-bedroom private estate above Puerto Banús on the Marbella coast, in a gated community overlooking Los Flamingos golf club, with views across the countryside to the Mediterranean. It has heated indoor and outdoor pools, a sauna and jacuzzi, a tennis court, a putting green, an outdoor bar and BBQ area, and air-conditioned en-suite bedrooms throughout.",
